  [P1-04]  STOCK VALUATION REPORT
  Priority : CRITICAL | Effort : S | Dependency : None
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  BUSINESS CONTEXT
  ----------------
  The owner cannot currently see: "What is the total value of all my stock right
  now at cost price?" This is essential for:
