  - /stocktake/[id]/count       — counting view: product list with qty input fields
  - /stocktake/[id]/review      — variance review: show only items with variance
  - PDF: Stocktake report (system qty, counted qty, variance per product)

  APPROVAL LOGIC
  --------------
  On approval:
