────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  [P2-01]  SUPPLIER RETURNS / DEBIT NOTE
  Priority : IMPORTANT | Effort : M | Dependency : None
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  BUSINESS CONTEXT
  ----------------
  When a shop receives wrong, damaged, or over-delivered goods from a supplier,
  they need to return items and raise a Debit Note reducing what is owed to that
  supplier. Currently there is no module for this. Returns to suppliers are done
  informally and supplier credit balances are manually adjusted with no record.

  WORKFLOW
  --------
  SELECT PURCHASE (GRN) → SELECT ITEMS TO RETURN → ENTER REASON
  → DEBIT NOTE GENERATED → SUPPLIER CREDIT BALANCE REDUCED

  USER STORIES
  ------------
  As a STORE_KEEPER, I want to record items being returned to a supplier with a
  reason and quantity, so the supplier balance is correctly adjusted.

  DATABASE TABLES NEEDED
  ----------------------
  supplier_returns:
    id                  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY
    purchase_id         BIGINT REFERENCES purchases(id)
    supplier_id         BIGINT REFERENCES suppliers(id)
    debit_note_number   TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE
    total_return_amount NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL
    notes               TEXT
    created_by          UUID REFERENCES users(id)
    created_at          TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()

  supplier_return_items:
    id              BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY
    return_id       BIGINT REFERENCES supplier_returns(id) ON DELETE CASCADE
    product_id      BIGINT REFERENCES products(id)
    quantity        NUMERIC(10,3) NOT NULL
    unit_price      NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL
    total_price     NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL
    reason          TEXT NOT NULL

  ON RETURN:
    UPDATE suppliers SET credit_balance = credit_balance - return_amount
    UPDATE products  SET stock_quantity = stock_quantity - returned_qty

  SCREENS NEEDED
  --------------
  - /supplier-returns           — list of all debit notes
  - /supplier-returns/new       — create return (select purchase, select items)
  - /supplier-returns/[id]      — view debit note detail
  - PDF: Debit Note document

  ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA
  -------------------
  [ ] Return can only be raised against an existing purchase
  [ ] Quantity returned cannot exceed quantity originally received
  [ ] Supplier credit_balance is reduced by return amount
  [ ] Product stock_quantity is reduced by returned quantity
  [ ] Debit note PDF generated with all return details
  [ ] Audit log records the return


