  Recommended: Option A (simple) — faster to build, covers 90% of cases.

  DATABASE CHANGES (Option A)
  ---------------------------
  ALTER TABLE products ADD COLUMN wholesale_price NUMERIC(12,2);
  ALTER TABLE customers ADD COLUMN customer_type TEXT DEFAULT 'RETAIL'
