  FILE USAGE NOTES FOR DEVELOPER
================================================================================

  - When starting a feature, update STATUS from PENDING → IN_PROGRESS → DONE
  - Each feature section is self-contained — read it, build it, mark it done
  - All new database tables must have RLS policies following the existing pattern
    in schema.sql (see PART 5 — RLS POLICIES)
  - All new server actions go in src/actions/ following the existing pattern
  - All new Zod schemas go in src/lib/validations/
  - All new pages go under src/app/(dashboard)/[feature-name]/
  - Role access: follow the existing role matrix (ADMIN > OWNER > CASHIER/STORE_KEEPER)
  - Every write operation (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE) must call writeAuditLog()
  - All PDF components go in src/components/pdf/

